      "created_at": "2026-01-13T09:35:22.425Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The calendar does not have time slots for every day like it used to have in version 15.</p>\n<p>It even says on the bottom “select or drag across time slots to create a new event”</p>\n<p>I tried both Firefox and chrome on windows 11 but its still the same.</p>\n<p>In safari on iOS the calendar doesn’t even show. It’s just a blank page.</p>\n<p>Is it a setting i need to enable or a bug? i tried looking through all the settings already but couldn’t find anything.</p>\n<p>Can someone please help and tell me if this a problem on my end or if its the same way for you?</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/e/d/ed998fbf22419df03b7252ffa2f562260473ff67.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/ed998fbf22419df03b7252ffa2f562260473ff67\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/e/d/ed998fbf22419df03b7252ffa2f562260473ff67_2_579x500.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"xTUacosOU5mPQhZK6SEMfsR5reL\" width=\"579\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/e/d/ed998fbf22419df03b7252ffa2f562260473ff67_2_579x500.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/e/d/ed998fbf22419df03b7252ffa2f562260473ff67.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/e/d/ed998fbf22419df03b7252ffa2f562260473ff67.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"1F1F1F\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">794×685 16.2 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
